                <pb facs="0649" n="599" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg599"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-10-18"><hi rendition="#italic">October 18,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister ultramar admits that Cuban repertory is translation. English version
                    maintains that neither in ministry states nor elsewhere is there any knowledge
                    of a Spanish version signed by Spanish minister being in existence. Minister
                    ultramar promises to recognize Spanish version attested by Spanish minister when
                    received here. Have minister send such copy at once. Meantime ultramar
                    telegraphs to suspend proceedings Aguilera case.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
